Template: bibliograph/port
Type: string
Default: 5000
Description: port for the Bibliograph application server:
 Bibliograph binds this port on 127.0.0.1, and the nginx site installed by
 this package proxies https://biblio.livtet.olamaelcu.net to it.
 .
 Keep the default unless another service on this host already uses it.
 .
 Change it later with: dpkg-reconfigure bibliograph

Template: bibliograph/port_invalid
Type: error
Description: Invalid port number.
 The port must be a whole number between 1 and 65535.
